{"src":"ht","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":217700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ht","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10842.974797,"text":"lèfini moyiz touye towo a li tranpe dwèt li nan san towo a li mete ti degout san sou kat kwen lotèl la"},{"kind":"text","t":11380.978626,"text":"Finally, Moses killed the bull, dipped his finger in the bull's blood, and put a little bit of blood on the four corners of the altar."},{"kind":"audio","t":11454.423808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11457.719503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":11460.580494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11461.889866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11463.300507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11464.746277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":11465.365609,"samples":13992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":21607.172034,"text":"lè lè a va rive tout moun ki fè pati pè pou a epi ki gen non yo ekri nan liv bondye a va souve"},{"kind":"text","t":22107.999498,"text":"When the time comes, everyone who is part of the people of God and whose names are written in the book of God will be saved."},{"kind":"audio","t":22185.354257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22190.671665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22196.111601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22201.463708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22206.601208,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22211.820477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":22212.34058,"samples":1992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":28358.19133,"text":"li nan bous nou li nan tèt nou pou nou ka fè sa l mande nou fè"},{"kind":"text","t":28744.318362,"text":"It is in our pockets and in our heads so that we can do what he asks us to do."},{"kind":"audio","t":28788.236835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28789.867453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":28791.713178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28793.647762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":28793.911558,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":41672.914486,"text":"sa l fè li chwazi pi bon sòlda nan lame pèp izrayèl la li mete yo an pozisyon devan lame moun aram yo"},{"kind":"text","t":42232.149676,"text":"What he did was choose the best soldiers in the army of the people of Israel and place them in position in front of the army of the Arameans."},{"kind":"audio","t":42298.553893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42303.741213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42309.031161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42314.177381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42319.43489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":42324.719318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42330.197413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":42330.534429,"samples":2824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51763.831113,"text":"men peyi nou pral separe an pòsyon pou nou bay chak branch fanmi pèp izrayèl la pa yo"},{"kind":"text","t":52250.691376,"text":"But the land we are going to is being divided into portions to give each branch of the family of the people of Israel their own."},{"kind":"audio","t":52313.937766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52319.059727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52324.313596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":52329.516895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52334.900252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52340.15913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52343.063981,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":63953.397969,"text":"tè ki te vin pou moun fanmi jozèf yo te kòmanse bò larivyè jouden anfas lavil jeriko sou bò solèy leve"},{"kind":"text","t":64424.590746,"text":"The land that was for the family of Joseph began by the Jordan River, opposite the city of Jericho, on the east side."},{"kind":"audio","t":64488.125272000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64493.205673000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":64498.399923000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64503.644361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64508.90678999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":64514.467724,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":64514.80149,"samples":7392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75218.812685,"text":"pou mache sòti mòn sinayi rive kadèz beneya lè ou swiv wout ki pase nan mòn seyi a sa pran on jou"},{"kind":"text","t":75675.900633,"text":"To walk from Mount Sinai to Kadesh Barnea, following the route that passes through Mount Seir, takes one day."},{"kind":"audio","t":75737.731633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75742.876283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":75748.055883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75753.334761,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":75759.035653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":75759.924071,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87729.133833,"text":"se ak kwiv sa yo salomon te fè wobasann lann pòt won yo ak klòt veso ann kwiv pou tanp plann"},{"kind":"text","t":88188.47021,"text":"It was with this bronze that Solomon made the two bronze pillars, the round doors, and the bronze vessels for the temple."},{"kind":"audio","t":88250.123213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88255.189604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88260.280314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":88265.447114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":88270.608044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88275.672545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":88276.003471,"samples":1392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98415.235881,"text":"men sa m'ap mande bondye pou nou li menm ki te fè jezi grangadò mouton yo"},{"kind":"text","t":98778.267968,"text":"But what I am asking God for us, who made Jesus the great shepherd of the sheep."},{"kind":"audio","t":98834.850919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98840.021768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98845.319776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98850.124601,"samples":32496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":101823.270797,"text":"leve sòti vivan pami mò yo"},{"kind":"text","t":101975.276101,"text":"rise alive from among the dead"},{"kind":"audio","t":102035.067639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102035.889417,"samples":29032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":109988.483864,"text":"se yo ki pou òganize tout fèt mwen yo dapre lòd ak regleman mwen bay"},{"kind":"text","t":110357.674117,"text":"They are the ones who are to organize all my parties according to the orders and regulations I give."},{"kind":"audio","t":110417.206917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110422.547435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":110427.711275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110433.010653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110438.645876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":110438.947672,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115859.960872,"text":"yo mete young rwad rwouj forse souli"},{"kind":"text","t":116102.514895,"text":"They put Young Rwad Rwouj on force there."},{"kind":"audio","t":116151.314252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116152.802082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116153.254726,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":125034.611161,"text":"m ap bay li depan m epi nou te mèt fèm konfyans ak kòs favè bondye fèm nan ke sansib li gen pou mwen an"},{"kind":"text","t":125531.184912,"text":"I will put him in front of me, and you can trust me, by the grace of God and the kindness he has for me."},{"kind":"audio","t":125591.258136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125596.459295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125601.729104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125607.073051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125612.462858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":125612.809063,"samples":8360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134041.832875,"text":"wi y'a pran yon branch bwa nan men chèf chak branch fanmi"},{"kind":"text","t":134398.036114,"text":"Yes, they will take a wooden branch from the hand of the head of each family branch."},{"kind":"audio","t":134465.28112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134470.509889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134475.486881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":134480.988317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":134481.341592,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141541.659534,"text":"menm si yon nèg gen anpil kouraj fè plis pase bit patat"},{"kind":"text","t":141913.353163,"text":"even if a man has a lot of courage, he can do more than just dig for sweet potatoes"},{"kind":"audio","t":141960.64819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141965.930858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":141971.233946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141976.442545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":141978.264761,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":152864.332222,"text":"paske se pou ou tout otorite tout pouvwa ak tout lwanj depi tout tan ak pou tout tan"},{"kind":"text","t":153234.988055,"text":"because all authority, all power, and all praise belong to you from all time and for all time"},{"kind":"audio","t":153296.066574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153301.169685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153306.636161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153311.81636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153315.047547,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":162224.976903,"text":"miche est-ce que c'est poune à l'attaquer la ville ramotte nan peyi galarad"},{"kind":"text","t":162612.375098,"text":"Miche, is it for us to attack the city of Ramotte in the country of Galarad?"},{"kind":"audio","t":162657.10385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162662.346609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162667.894174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162671.185769,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":177352.640082,"text":"ou sinon èske se pou n kite sa yon moun ki pa janm bite nan pawòl li se yon moun ki bon nèt moun sa a kapab kontwole tout kò l byen tou"},{"kind":"text","t":177887.838618,"text":"Or otherwise, should we leave it to someone who never goes back on their word, someone who is completely good, someone who can fully control themselves?"},{"kind":"audio","t":177954.220456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":177959.278708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177964.530786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177970.211049,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177974.837526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177980.217663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177985.531311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":177987.278767,"samples":17224,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":191769.167215,"text":"devan gwo difikilte sa a popilasyon an pa konnen ki sen pou l rele pou vin sove yo anba gwo flewo sa a"},{"kind":"text","t":192228.64653,"text":"Faced with this great difficulty, the population does not know which saint to call upon to save them from this great scourge."},{"kind":"audio","t":192290.878135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192295.957356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192301.50284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192306.945576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192312.286864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192317.268026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":192317.562762,"samples":192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":204253.864631,"text":"moun branch fanmi neftali yo pat mete moun kanaran yo deyò nan lavil bèt chemench ni nan lavil bèt anat"},{"kind":"text","t":204903.155207,"text":"The people of the family branch of Naphtali did not cast out the people of Garan from the city of Bet-Shemesh nor from the city of Bet-Anath."},{"kind":"audio","t":204957.612767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204962.800306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204967.820338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204973.172825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204978.484713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204983.751162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204988.348829,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":216974.019867,"text":"alò yon moun ki gen yon fanmi ki gen tèt ansanm se menm jan ak yon moun ki mennen yon lavi san pwoblèm"},{"kind":"text","t":217402.480614,"text":"Therefore, a person who has a family that stands together is just like a person who leads a life without problems."},{"kind":"audio","t":217465.118253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217470.392101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217475.543531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":217480.891699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217486.249956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217490.35918,"samples":28160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"close","t":227804.956567,"code":1005}]}